s06_div_zero — classification: runtime-trap

filled fill ran and trapped: wasm trap: integer divide by zero (exit=134)

Reproduce (from repo root):
  source tools/wt-env.sh
  d=$(mktemp -d /tmp/cru_XXXX); cp tests/fuzz/crucibles/s06_div_zero/s06_div_zero.mn $d/
  wt_run boot/mentl.wasm < $d/s06_div_zero.mn > $d/s06_div_zero.wat
  wt_asm $d/s06_div_zero.wat $d/s06_div_zero.wasm && wt_run $d/s06_div_zero.wasm   # traps at runtime

Shrunk with wasm-tools 842B -> 131B (predicate: still traps 'integer divide by zero').
  wasm-tools shrink ./shrink-predicate.sh s06_div_zero.wasm -o s06_div_zero.shrunk.wasm
